---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Community
seoTitle: Niwot Community Organizations & Resident Resources
description: Niwot has no town hall, so residents run it. The organizations that hold things together, and the county bodies and districts responsible for each public service.
navKey: community
permalink: /community/
ogImage: niwot-tribune-storefront.jpg
ogImageAlt: The Niwot Tribune false-front building on Second Avenue
# The order of the resident-resource groups. Each row in services.js names
# its group; a group with no rows renders nothing.
groups:
  - Land, roads and permits
  - Safety and emergencies
  - Water and sewer
  - Schools, parks and elections
pageStyles: |
  .n-community-open{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.82fr) minmax(0,1.18fr);gap:clamp(28px,4vw,68px);align-items:center}
  .n-community-open figure{min-width:0}
  .n-community-kicker{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));margin-top:clamp(24px,3vw,40px);border-top:1px solid var(--n-rule);border-bottom:1px solid var(--n-rule)}
  .n-community-kicker a{display:block;padding:16px 14px 15px 0;color:var(--n-evergreen);font-size:.875rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;border-right:1px solid var(--n-rule)}
  .n-community-kicker a:not(:first-child){padding-left:14px}
  .n-community-kicker a:last-child{border-right:0}
  .n-community-kicker a:hover{color:var(--n-red-ink)}
  .n-srow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.8fr) minmax(0,1fr) minmax(130px,auto);gap:12px 28px;align-items:baseline;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--n-rule)}
  .n-org-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1px;margin:clamp(24px,3vw,40px) 0 0 !important;background:rgba(36,72,58,.22);border:1px solid rgba(36,72,58,.22)}
  .n-org-card{display:flex;min-height:310px;flex-direction:column;padding:clamp(24px,3vw,38px);background:var(--n-white)}
  .n-org-card--public{min-height:270px;background:var(--n-sky-pale)}
  .n-org-card .n-link{margin-top:auto;align-self:flex-start}
  .n-org-num{font-family:var(--n-serif);font-size:2rem;line-height:1;color:var(--n-red-ink)}
  .n-toc{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 22px;list-style:none;margin:16px 0 0;padding:0}
  .n-sgroup{margin-top:clamp(22px,2.6vw,36px)}
  .n-sgroup h3{margin:0;padding-bottom:8px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--n-evergreen)}
  /* Both lists stack at the same width. Left in two columns on a phone, the
     140px reserved for "Visit site" leaves about 150px for the body copy,
     which reads four words to a line. */
  @media (max-width:900px){.n-community-open,.n-org-grid,.n-srow{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.n-org-card{min-height:0}}
  @media (max-width:620px){.n-community-kicker{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.n-community-kicker a,.n-community-kicker a:not(:first-child){padding:13px 0;border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--n-rule)}.n-community-kicker a:last-child{border-bottom:0}}
---
<section class="n-bg-white" aria-labelledby="title-h">
<div class="n-wrap" style="padding-top:clamp(28px,4vw,60px);padding-bottom:clamp(36px,5vw,76px)">
<div class="n-community-open">
<div>
<div class="n-label">The people who make Niwot work</div>
<h1 class="n-display" id="title-h" style="margin-top:14px;font-size:clamp(2.75rem,2.05rem + 3vw,5.25rem);line-height:.93;max-width:11ch;color:var(--n-evergreen)">Community Groups &amp; Resident Resources</h1>
<p class="n-lead" style="margin:clamp(20px,2.5vw,34px) 0 0;max-width:46ch">Without a town hall, local groups organize the gatherings, arts and business district. County offices and special districts handle most public services.</p>
<nav class="n-community-kicker" aria-label="On this page">
<a href="#orgs">Community groups &#8595;</a>
<a href="#public">Public bodies &#8595;</a>
<a href="#resources">Resident help &#8595;</a>
</nav>
</div>
<figure class="n-photo-natural" style="margin:0">
{% photo "niwot-tribune-storefront.jpg", "The complete Niwot Tribune false-front building on Second Avenue, including its painted sign, shingled porch roof and storefront", "(max-width: 900px) calc(100vw - 48px), (max-width: 1440px) 52vw, 700px", "display:block;width:100%;height:auto;object-fit:contain", true %}
<figcaption class="n-cap">The Niwot Tribune storefront on Second Avenue</figcaption>
</figure>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="n-bg-paper n-pad" id="orgs" aria-labelledby="orgs-h" style="border-top:1px solid var(--n-rule)">
<div class="n-wrap">
<div class="n-shead n-shead-row" style="border-bottom-color:var(--n-evergreen)">
<div>
<div class="n-label">Who organizes what</div>
<h2 class="n-h2" id="orgs-h" style="margin-top:12px;color:var(--n-evergreen)">Community groups</h2>
</div>
<a class="n-link" href="/contact/">Add your organization <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
</div>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:clamp(18px,2vw,28px) 0 0;max-width:72ch">Volunteer and membership organizations. Each line says what the group actually runs, so you know which one to approach for what.</p>
<ul class="n-org-grid" data-orgs-community style="list-style:none;padding:0">
{%- for o in organizations %}{% if o.kind == 'community' %}
<li class="n-org-card">
<div class="n-org-num" aria-hidden="true">0{{ loop.index }}</div>
<h3 class="n-h3" style="font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--n-evergreen)">{{ o.name }}</h3>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:10px 0 0;max-width:64ch;font-size:.9375rem">{{ o.body }}</p>
<div class="n-label n-label--quiet" style="margin-top:10px;font-size:12px">Runs: {{ o.runs }}</div>
<a class="n-link" href="{{ o.href }}" rel="noopener" style="display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap">{{ o.linkLabel }} <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
</li>
{%- endif %}{% endfor %}
</ul>
<h2 class="n-h2" id="public" style="margin-top:clamp(36px,4.5vw,64px);font-size:clamp(1.5rem,1.2rem + 1.2vw,2.25rem);color:var(--n-evergreen)">Public bodies with a Niwot remit</h2>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:14px 0 0;max-width:72ch">Public administration, not clubs: each is part of, or appointed through, government, and is approached as such.</p>
<ul class="n-org-grid" data-orgs-public style="list-style:none;padding:0">
{%- for o in organizations %}{% if o.kind == 'public' %}
<li class="n-org-card n-org-card--public">
<div class="n-label" style="color:var(--n-sky-ink)">Public body</div>
<h3 class="n-h3" style="font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--n-evergreen)">{{ o.name }}</h3>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:10px 0 0;max-width:64ch;font-size:.9375rem">{{ o.body }}</p>
<div class="n-label n-label--quiet" style="margin-top:10px;font-size:12px">Runs: {{ o.runs }}</div>
<a class="n-link" href="{{ o.href }}" rel="noopener" style="display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap">{{ o.linkLabel }} <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
</li>
{%- endif %}{% endfor %}
</ul>
</div>
</section>

<section class="n-bg-green n-pad-sm" aria-labelledby="where-h">
<div class="n-wrap">
<div class="n-g2-wide" style="align-items:center">
<figure class="n-photo-natural" style="margin:0">
{% photo "whistle-stop-caboose.jpg", "The red CB&Q 14649 caboose at Whistle Stop Park, where Niwot's concerts and seasonal gatherings are held", "(max-width: 900px) calc(100vw - 48px), (max-width: 1440px) 38vw, 520px", "display:block;width:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 52%" %}
<figcaption class="n-cap">Whistle Stop Park &#8212; built and programmed by local volunteers</figcaption>
</figure>
<div>
<div class="n-label">Where community happens</div>
<h2 class="n-h2" id="where-h" style="margin-top:12px;max-width:14ch">Two blocks, one park, a lot of volunteers.</h2>
</div>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:0;max-width:60ch;color:var(--n-paper)">The summer concerts, art walks and seasonal gatherings are not municipal programs. They happen because residents and local organizations build the calendar, maintain the public art and keep showing up.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="n-bg-white n-pad" id="resources" aria-labelledby="res-h">
<div class="n-wrap">
<div class="n-shead">
<div class="n-label">Resident resources</div>
<h2 class="n-h2" id="res-h" style="color:var(--n-evergreen)">Who to contact for what</h2>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:0;max-width:74ch">Niwot is unincorporated, so there is no town hall. Services come from Boulder County, the special districts and a water district. Each row names the body responsible and links to the page of its site that handles that service.</p>
</div>
{%- for g in groups %}
<div class="n-sgroup">
<h3 class="n-label n-label--quiet" style="color:var(--n-evergreen)">{{ g }}</h3>
<dl style="margin:0">
{%- for s in services %}{% if s.group == g %}
<div class="n-srow">
<dt style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--n-evergreen)">{{ s.service }}</dt>
<dd class="n-body" style="margin:0;font-size:.9375rem">{{ s.handles }}</dd>
<dd style="margin:0">
<a class="n-link" href="{{ s.href }}" rel="noopener" style="white-space:nowrap;font-size:12px">{{ s.who }} <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
</dd>
</div>
{%- endif %}{% endfor %}
</dl>
</div>
{%- endfor %}
<div class="n-g2" style="margin-top:clamp(30px,3.6vw,52px)">
<div class="n-callout n-callout--paper">
<div class="n-label">Sewer and trash</div>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:.9375rem">Sewer service comes from the Niwot Sanitation District where its lines run &#8212; a special district with its own elected board, funded by its service fees, covering about seven square miles around Niwot &#8212; and from septic systems elsewhere. Check your address with the district. Trash and recycling collection is arranged household by household with a private hauler; there is no municipal service.</p>
<a class="n-link" href="https://niwotsd.colorado.gov/" rel="noopener" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:12px">Niwot Sanitation District <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
</div>
<div class="n-callout n-callout--sky">
<div class="n-label" style="color:var(--n-sky-ink)">In an emergency</div>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:.9375rem">Call 911. For non-emergency county matters, contact the Boulder County Sheriff&#8217;s Office directly rather than through this site.</p>
<a class="n-link" href="https://bouldercounty.gov/safety/sheriff/" rel="noopener" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:12px">Sheriff&#8217;s office <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="n-bg-green n-pad" aria-labelledby="get-h">
<div class="n-wrap">
<div class="n-g2-wide">
<div>
<div class="n-label">Get involved</div>
<h2 class="n-h2" id="get-h" style="margin-top:12px;max-width:16ch">The quickest way in is to turn up</h2>
</div>
<div>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:0;max-width:60ch;color:var(--n-paper)">The events calendar lists what has been published: the summer concerts beside the caboose, the art walks, and the seasonal gatherings in Old Town. Most of them are run by the groups above, and every one of them is looking for hands.</p>
<div class="n-btns" style="margin-top:24px">
<a class="n-btn" href="/events/">See what&#8217;s on</a>
<a class="n-btn n-btn--ghost" href="/civic/incorporation-election/">2026 election</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
